<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-TRANSVAL 88-1 AT TEA AGAINST BOLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TRANSVAL 88-1 AT TEA AGAINST BOLAND.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal were 88 for one from 29 overs at tea on the first day of the four-day Supersport Series match against Boland at the Wanderers.</p>
</text>
